  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Vulnerable Malian Refugees and Selected Host and IDP Communities Through Livelihoods and Protection Activities in the North Region of Burkina Faso Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fourth phase of this project seeks to reinforce social cohesion and strengthen resilience of populations affected by the crises in Burkina Faso. The project will assist affected populations through an increase in both joint and targeted livelihoods opportunities and access to protection for vulnerable asylum seekers and selected displaced persons and host communities in the North region of Burkina Faso.</narrative>
  </description>
